**JWT-утилита:**
```java
@Component
public class JwtUtil {
    private final String secret = "change-me";
    public String generate(String username) {
        return Jwts.builder()
            .setSubject(username)
            .setExpiration(new Date(System.currentTimeMillis() + 3600_000))
            .signWith(Keys.hmacShaKeyFor(secret.getBytes()))
            .compact();
    }
    public String parse(String token) {
        return Jwts.parserBuilder()
            .setSigningKey(secret.getBytes()).build()
            .parseClaimsJws(token).getBody().getSubject();
    }
}
```

**Контроллер:**
```java
@RestController
@RequestMapping("/auth")
public class AuthController {
    private final UserRepository users;
    private final PasswordEncoder encoder;
    private final JwtUtil jwt;

    public AuthController(UserRepository u, PasswordEncoder e, JwtUtil j) {
        this.users = u; this.encoder = e; this.jwt = j;
    }

    @PostMapping("/register")
    public void register(@RequestBody AuthRequest req) {
        User u = new User();
        u.setUsername(req.username());
        u.setPasswordHash(encoder.encode(req.password()));
        users.save(u);
    }

    @PostMapping("/login")
    public String login(@RequestBody AuthRequest req) {
        User u = users.findByUsername(req.username())
            .orElseThrow(() -> new RuntimeException("no user"));
        if (!encoder.matches(req.password(), u.getPasswordHash()))
            throw new RuntimeException("bad password");
        return jwt.generate(u.getUsername());
    }
}

record AuthRequest(String username, String password) {}
```

**Security конфиг:**
```java
@Configuration
@EnableWebSecurity
public class SecurityConfig {
    @Bean SecurityFilterChain chain(HttpSecurity http) throws Exception {
        return http.csrf(c -> c.disable())
            .authorizeHttpRequests(a -> a
                .requestMatchers("/auth/**").permitAll()
                .anyRequest().authenticated())
            .build();
    }
    @Bean PasswordEncoder encoder() {
        return new BCryptPasswordEncoder();
    }
}
```

