- драйвер БД

**2. Сущность пользователя**
```java
@Entity
@Table(name = "users")
public class User {
    @Id @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)
    private Long id;

    @Column(unique = true, nullable = false)
    private String username;

    @Column(nullable = false)
    private String password; // BCrypt hash

    private String role; // ROLE_USER / ROLE_ADMIN

    // getters/setters
}
```

**3. Репозиторий**
```java
public interface UserRepository extends JpaRepository<User, Long> {
    Optional<User> findByUsername(String username);
}
```

**4. UserDetailsService — мост между Hibernate и Security**
```java
@Service
public class AppUserDetailsService implements UserDetailsService {
    private final UserRepository repo;
    public AppUserDetailsService(UserRepository repo) { this.repo = repo; }

    @Override
    public UserDetails loadUserByUsername(String username) {
        User u = repo.findByUsername(username)
            .orElseThrow(() -> new UsernameNotFoundException(username));
        return org.springframework.security.core.userdetails.User
            .withUsername(u.getUsername())
            .password(u.getPassword())
            .roles(u.getRole().replace("ROLE_", ""))
            .build();
    }
}
```

**5. Конфигурация Security**
```java
@Configuration
@EnableWebSecurity
public class SecurityConfig {
    private final AppUserDetailsService uds;
    private final PasswordEncoder encoder = new BCryptPasswordEncoder();

    public SecurityConfig(AppUserDetailsService uds) { this.uds = uds; }

    @Bean
    SecurityFilterChain chain(HttpSecurity http) throws Exception {
        http
          .csrf(csrf -> csrf.disable()) // для API
          .authorizeHttpRequests(a -> a
              .requestMatchers("/register", "/login").permitAll()
              .anyRequest().authenticated())
          .userDetailsService(uds)
          .httpBasic(Customizer.withDefaults()); // или formLogin()
        return http.build();
    }

    @Bean PasswordEncoder passwordEncoder() { return encoder; }
}
```

**6. Регистрация (хеширование пароля)**
```java
@RestController
public class AuthController {
    private final UserRepository repo;
    private final PasswordEncoder encoder;

    @PostMapping("/register")
    public void register(@RequestBody User req) {
        req.setPassword(encoder.encode(req.getPassword()));
        req.setRole("ROLE_USER");
        repo.save(req);
    }
}
```

## Ключевая связь
`UserRepository` (Hibernate) → `UserDetailsService` → `SecurityFilterChain`.  
Security не ходит в БД сам — он спрашивает `UserDetailsService`, который через JPA читает `users`.

